pi-agent (grokbot-pi-agent-skill)
Copyright (c) 2026 peternowak2

This project packages a Grok Bot skill and installer around grokbot-local-agent:

  https://github.com/robbin/grokbot-local-agent
  Copyright (c) 2026 Robbin Fan
  Licensed under the MIT License.

Vendored from that repository, with the upstream copyright notice kept in each
file. The shell wrappers also prepend ~/.node22/bin to PATH so they find the
Node.js 22 install this repository's install.sh creates. No other behavioral
changes.

  bin/pi-call.mjs
  bin/pi-run
  bin/pi-task
  bin/pi-task.mjs
  routines/pi-task-notify.md

skills/pi-agent/SKILL.md is maintained in this repository. It describes the same
delegation, ownership, and webhook workflow.

